    "targetPlayers": "all: players in the round. everyone: players in the lobby and in the round. lobby: lobby only. me: you. others: everyone in the game except you. You can also type a username.",
    "targetAll": "all: players in the game. everyone: lobby and game. lobby: lobby only. me: you. others: everyone in the game except you. You can also type a username. For plates use plate-all, plate-nearest, or type plate-NUMBER for a specific plate."
